  factText: "Mycelium foods don\u2019t need farmland or long seasons. One startup\u2019s
    mycelium grows in a tank in just 8\u201310 days (versus months for soy or years
    for beef), using minimal land, energy and water. The fungus naturally tastes
    a bit meaty, making plant-based foods more savory and appealing."
